cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it along with the methods it builds on."
title: "3D Objects Counter - StarDist"
abstract: >-
  A Fiji/ImageJ plugin that counts and measures 3D objects in a Z-stack by
  running StarDist on each slice and linking the per-slice detections through Z
  with TrackMate's LAP tracker. Reports per-object volume, surface area,
  sphericity, compactness, elongation, Feret diameter, intensity statistics and
  position, produces object, surface, centroid and centre-of-mass maps and a 3D
  label image, applies minimum and maximum morphology filters, and processes
  folders in batch with recursive search and regex grouping.
type: software
# The distributed plugin links GPLv3+ libraries (TrackMate, TrackMate-StarDist)
# and cannot run without them, so the combined work is GPL-3.0-or-later. The
# original source in this repository is BSD-3-Clause. See LICENSING.md.
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
